              {
                "id": "p13-q9c-short-method",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Fix the T’s at the ends and treat III as one element.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "Fix one T at each end and treat III as one element. The six remaining elements are A, D, D, III, V and Y, with two identical D’s.\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=\\frac{6!}{2!}\\\\N&=360\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
